          "id": 806092239,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This doesn't seem to be working in latest build: 3.7.0rc0-1027-gb3d5ace216cd (v3.7.0rc0-1027-gb3d5ace216cd)  \n  \nThe similar code change for #17107 works great.",
