        },
        {
          "id": 806406425,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I wonder if the timeout is too short - when I changed it from 200 to 500, it seemed to work as expected. Perhaps there's some processing that's making it take more than 200ms after each keystroke?\n\nOn that note, I think it makes sense to make the debouncing time a preference. I'll create an issue for that for now.",
